---
import { Sliders, Database, Eye, Clock, Bot } from "lucide-astro";
---

<section id="features" class="py-24 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 sm:mb-20">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/20 text-rose-300 text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        Engineered for Modern Discord Communities
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
        Everything you need to run <br class="hidden sm:inline" />a bulletproof server
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-zinc-300">
        From granular interactive permission management to intelligent automated purges and
        community-friendly AI.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento Grid (3x2 or Asymmetric Grid) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <!-- Card 1: Interactive Dashboard (Span 2) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 rounded-2xl bg-[#0F121B] border border-white/10 hover:border-rose-500/30 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 group shadow-lg">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-400 border border-rose-500/20">
              <Sliders class="w-6 h-6" />
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white/5 text-zinc-400 border border-white/5">
              /antiphishing settings
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">
            Interactive Discord Settings Dashboard
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-300 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
            No messy JSON or complicated config files needed in Discord. Manage enforcement actions
            (<code class="text-rose-300">timeout</code>, <code class="text-rose-300">kick</code>,{" "}
            <code class="text-rose-300">ban</code>, <code class="text-rose-300">warn</code>), alert
            channels, bypass roles, and custom user DMs through native modals and components.
          </p>

          <!-- Interactive UI Preview inside card -->
          <div class="mt-6 rounded-xl bg-[#080A0F] border border-white/10 p-4 font-discord text-xs space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/5 pb-2">
              <span class="font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
                🛡️ Anti-Phishing Settings — CyberHub Community
              </span>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 font-mono text-[10px]">
                🟢 Active
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-[11px]">
              <div class="bg-white/5 p-2 rounded">
                <span class="text-zinc-400 block text-[10px]">Action</span>
                <span class="text-white font-semibold">Timeout (7d)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white/5 p-2 rounded">
                <span class="text-zinc-400 block text-[10px]">Alerts</span>
                <span class="text-rose-300 font-semibold">#mod-security</span>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white/5 p-2 rounded">
                <span class="text-zinc-400 block text-[10px]">Mod Roles</span>
                <span class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold">@Senior Mod</span>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white/5 p-2 rounded">
                <span class="text-zinc-400 block text-[10px]">Bypass Role</span>
                <span class="text-amber-300 font-semibold">@Bot Master</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-rose-400 font-semibold">
          <span>Configurable live in Discord without bot restarts</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Turso libSQL Cloud Threat Sync (Span 1) -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#0F121B] border border-white/10 hover:border-rose-500/30 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 group shadow-lg">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-400 border border-sky-500/20">
              <Database class="w-6 h-6" />
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white/5 text-zinc-400 border border-white/5">
              Turso / libSQL
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Shared Threat Cloud</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
            Every malicious URL discovered across your servers is indexed into a distributed Turso
            database. When one community identifies a new scam campaign, all protected guilds gain
            immediate immunity.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400">
          <span>Global Latency</span>
          <span class="text-sky-400 font-semibold">&lt; 15ms query</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Non-Destructive Test Sandbox (Span 1) -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#0F121B] border border-white/10 hover:border-rose-500/30 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 group shadow-lg">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/20">
              <Eye class="w-6 h-6" />
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white/5 text-zinc-400 border border-white/5">
              /test &lt;message_id&gt;
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Zero-Harm Forensics Sandbox</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
            Need to evaluate a reported link without issuing a false penalty? The{" "}
            <code class="text-amber-300">/test</code> command parses message references,
            reconstructs embeds, and outputs an audit log to your mod room without touching the
            member.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400">
          <span>Safe Inspection</span>
          <span class="text-amber-400 font-semibold">100% Non-Punitive</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Automated Scheduled Purge & Clear (Span 1) -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#0F121B] border border-white/10 hover:border-rose-500/30 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 group shadow-lg">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 border border-purple-500/20">
              <Clock class="w-6 h-6" />
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white/5 text-zinc-400 border border-white/5">
              CLEAR_CHANNEL_ID
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Daily Auto-Purge at 3 AM</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
            Keep command lobbies, scratchpads, and temporary voice-chat logs crystal clean. Specify
            a channel ID to trigger an automated purge every night at 3:00 AM UTC, or run fine-tuned
            filter sweeps with <code class="text-purple-300">/clear</code>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400">
          <span>Filters</span>
          <span class="text-purple-400 font-semibold">User / Bots-Only</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 5: Groq Anime AI Companion (Span 1) -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#0F121B] border border-white/10 hover:border-rose-500/30 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 group shadow-lg">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-400 border border-rose-500/20">
              <Bot class="w-6 h-6" />
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white/5 text-zinc-400 border border-white/5">
              /ask powered by Groq
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Playful Anime AI Companion</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
            More than just security rules: Tsubaki chats with members using cheerful Japanglish,
            tsundere banter, and expressive kaomoji. Equipped with per-user spam rate limits and
            prompt jailbreak refusal guidelines.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400">
          <span>Engine</span>
          <span class="text-rose-400 font-semibold">Llama 3 / GPT-OSS on Groq</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
